WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,910 --> 00:00:04,770
Why not go around Qingsong City?

2
00:00:04,770 --> 00:00:06,930
That's safer too

3
00:00:06,930 --> 00:00:09,310
I have to recruit some forces willing to help me

4
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:11,470
For example, the Liu Family in Qingsong City

5
00:00:11,470 --> 00:00:15,740
It’s the gold-medal Beijing guest Guidao Yuelian

6
00:00:15,740 --> 00:00:17,740
and the murderer Wang Han

7
00:00:17,740 --> 00:00:23,900
Looks like you found the right person

8
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:34,670
Is this what you mean?

9
00:00:34,670 --> 00:00:36,800
follow me

10
00:00:36,800 --> 00:00:38,800
Otherwise your head

11
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:57,990
It will explode like this table.

12
00:00:57,990 --> 00:01:00,990
Who dares to cause trouble in Qingsong City, go away

13
00:01:00,990 --> 00:01:07,020
Kill me with your hands

14
00:01:07,020 --> 00:01:10,910
Why do you want to hit me, miss?

15
00:01:10,910 --> 00:01:11,910
Are you okay? Are you injured?
